                                "sense_id": "160981c4-e829-3511-acc6-1dc94cfb7f78",
                                "text": "The evidence shows that most of the meetings attended by the wadding manufacturers were meetings of the Canadian Quilting Manufacturers Association. The wadders had but a few meetings of their own […]"
