                                "sense_id": "160981c4-e829-3511-acc6-1dc94cfb7f78",
                                "text": "Weavers, reelers, wadders and those working in the filature refused to move, and when forced, produced inferior quality goods or ran away at the earliest opportunity, partly because they were separated from their families […]"
                            }
